Atari816 - licence map
=======================

This repository is not under a single licence. Each directory has its own
licence, stated in a LICENSE file in that directory. The full licence texts
are in LICENSES/ (and, for third-party components of the hardware, in
core/LICENSES/).

  horizon/        GPL-3.0-or-later              horizon/LICENSE
  emu/            GPL-3.0-or-later              emu/LICENSE
  sdk/            MIT                           sdk/LICENSE
  Docs/           CC-BY-SA-4.0                  Docs/LICENSE
  core/           original work: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0 OR GPL-3.0-or-later,
                  at your option                core/LICENSE-PORT
                  third-party components: their own licences
                                                core/LICENSE

Bitstreams built from core/ are for NON-COMMERCIAL use only, because the
Atari 8-bit core they contain (Mark Watson's atari800core) is offered by its
author for non-commercial use only. core/LICENSE, section 1 and section 3,
explains this, including its tension with the GPL of some components.

Full texts:
  LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt           GNU General Public License v3.0
  LICENSES/MIT.txt               MIT License
  LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt      Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
  LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt   Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-
                                 ShareAlike 4.0
  core/LICENSES/                 the texts and notices of the hardware's
                                 third-party components (Apache-2.0, LGPL-2.1,
                                 BSD-3-Clause, MIT, Mark Watson's notice)

Every source file's own header notice is authoritative for that file.

Atari and related names are trademarks of their respective owners. This
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Atari.
